{
    "title": "FOX 5 Atlanta: News",
    "description": "News doesn't wait, why should you? Take FOX 5 Atlanta everywhere you go! Our app connects you with top stories in and around the ATL\u2014 complete with breaking news alerts, live video, and real-time weather forecasts.\r\n\r\nWe cover topics that matter most to you including local & national headlines, weather, sports, traffic, politics, entertainment, food, education, crime and so much more.\r\n\r\n NEWS & VIDEO\r\n - Breaking news delivered as fast as it breaks\r\n- Live stream newscasts daily\r\n - Streamlined content display for a user-friendly experience \r\n\r\nWEATHER\r\n - Hourly conditions and 7-day forecasts so you're always prepared for your day\r\n - Interactive radar 24 hours a day\r\n - Video updates from FOX 5 meteorologists \r\n\r\n GOOD DAY ATLANTA\r\n - Catch up every morning and watch what you missed\r\n - Browse delicious recipes for dinner, lunch and breakfast\r\n - Pet parent? Visit our pets page for our Pet of the Day feature\r\n\r\nSPORTS\r\n - Fresh updates on the Falcons, Braves, United, and Hawks\r\n\r\n\r\nLET\u2019S BE FRIENDS! Follow us on:\r\n \u2022 facebook.com/fox5atlanta\r\n \u2022 instagram.com/fox5atlanta\r\n \u2022 twitter.com/fox5atlanta\r\n Use #FOX5ATL to join the chatter and be featured.\r\n\r\n\r\nOur News App provides you the option to enable specific geolocation tracking for precise location-based advertisements (review our Privacy Policy for more information on our use and sharing of location information).\r\n\r\nWe may work with mobile advertising companies and other similar entities that help deliver advertisements tailored to your interests. For more information about such advertising practices, and to opt-out in mobile apps, see https://www.fox5atlanta.com/ad-choices. You may also download the App Choices app at https://www.aboutads.info/appchoices.",
    "descriptionHTML": "News doesn&#39;t wait, why should you? Take FOX 5 Atlanta everywhere you go! Our app connects you with top stories in and around the ATL\u2014 complete with breaking news alerts, live video, and real-time weather forecasts.<br><br>We cover topics that matter most to you including local &amp; national headlines, weather, sports, traffic, politics, entertainment, food, education, crime and so much more.<br><br> NEWS &amp; VIDEO<br> - Breaking news delivered as fast as it breaks<br>- Live stream newscasts daily<br> - Streamlined content display for a user-friendly experience <br><br>WEATHER<br> - Hourly conditions and 7-day forecasts so you&#39;re always prepared for your day<br> - Interactive radar 24 hours a day<br> - Video updates from FOX 5 meteorologists <br><br> GOOD DAY ATLANTA<br> - Catch up every morning and watch what you missed<br> - Browse delicious recipes for dinner, lunch and breakfast<br> - Pet parent? Visit our pets page for our Pet of the Day feature<br><br>SPORTS<br> - Fresh updates on the Falcons, Braves, United, and Hawks<br><br><br>LET\u2019S BE FRIENDS! Follow us on:<br> \u2022 facebook.com/fox5atlanta<br> \u2022 instagram.com/fox5atlanta<br> \u2022 twitter.com/fox5atlanta<br> Use #FOX5ATL to join the chatter and be featured.<br><br><br>Our News App provides you the option to enable specific geolocation tracking for precise location-based advertisements (review our Privacy Policy for more information on our use and sharing of location information).<br><br>We may work with mobile advertising companies and other similar entities that help deliver advertisements tailored to your interests. For more information about such advertising practices, and to opt-out in mobile apps, see https://www.fox5atlanta.com/ad-choices. You may also download the App Choices app at https://www.aboutads.info/appchoices.",
